          "text": "\n\n## Project Architecture Overview\n\n**Entire** is a CLI tool built with **Cobra** (CLI framework) and **Huh** (TUI library) in **Go 1.26.x**.\n\n### Key Components\n\n**Directory Structure:**\n- `cmd/entire/` - Main CLI entry + external command resolution\n- `cmd/entire/cli/commands/` - Command implementations\n- `cmd/entire/cli/agent/` - Agent integrations (Claude Code, Gemini CLI, OpenCode, Cursor, Factory AI Droid, Copilot CLI, Pi)\n- `cmd/entire/cli/strategy/` - Manual-commit strategy for checkpointing\n- `cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint/` - Checkpoint storage (temporary + committed)\n- `cmd/entire/cli/session/` - Session state management\n- `cmd/entire/cli/review/` - Code review functionality\n- `e2e/` - E2E tests\n\n### Core Architecture\n\n1. **Agent Integration** - Inversion of control pattern: agents translate native hooks → normalized events → framework handles orchestration. Each agent implements the `Agent` interface (19 methods) plus optional interfaces for hooks, transcript analysis, token calculation, etc.\n\n2. **Manual-Commit Strategy** - Uses shadow branches (`entire/<commit-hash>-<worktreeHash>`) for temporary checkpoints, condenses to `entire/checkpoints/v1` on user commits. Safe for main/master - never modifies active branch history.\n\n3. **Checkpoint System** - 12-hex-char checkpoint IDs for bidirectional linking between user commits and metadata. Sharded storage (256 shards) on metadata branch.\n\n4. **Session State Machine** - Phases: `ACTIVE`, `IDLE`, `ENDED`. Events: `TurnStart`, `TurnEnd`, `GitCommit`, `SessionStart`, `SessionStop`.\n\n5. **External Agent Protocol** - Supports plugins via `entire-agent-<name>` binaries on PATH, using JSON over stdin/stdout.\n\n### Commands\n\nNoun groups: `session`, `checkpoint`, `agent`, `configure`, `auth`, `doctor`\nTop-level: `enable`, `disable`, `status`, `login`, `logout`, `clean`, `version`, `dispatch`, `activity`, `review`\n\n### Key Files for Reference\n\n| Purpose | File |\n|---------|------|\n| Agent interface | `cmd/entire/cli/agent/agent.go` |\n| Lifecycle dispatch | `cmd/entire/cli/lifecycle.go` |\n| Strategy interface | `cmd/entire/cli/strategy/strategy.go` |\n| Manual-commit impl | `cmd/entire/cli/strategy/manual_commit*.go` |\n| Review command | `cmd/entire/cli/review/cmd.go` |\n| Settings | `cmd/entire/cli/settings/settings.go` |",
