        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\n\n## Antigravity Integration Gap\n\n**No, Entire CLI does not support Antigravity.** This is a significant gap since Antigravity (Google's new agentic IDE) was released in November 2025 and is gaining traction.\n\n### Key Antigravity Features Missing in Entire\n\n| Feature | Antigravity | Entire CLI |\n|---------|-------------|------------|\n| **Agent Manager** | Mission control for parallel agents across workspaces | ❌ No multi-agent orchestration UI |\n| **Artifacts System** | Plans, task lists, screenshots, recordings, walkthroughs | ❌ Only checkpoint metadata |\n| **Browser Automation** | Agent drives Chrome for UI testing/verification | ❌ No browser integration |\n| **Knowledge Base** | Agents learn patterns from past tasks | ❌ Checkpoints don't learn |\n| **Multi-model routing** | Gemini, Claude, GPT-OSS in same tool | ❌ Uses agent's model only |\n| **Review Policies** | Configurable safety rails for autonomy | ❌ `entire review` exists but limited |\n| **Async Feedback** | Comment on artifacts without stopping agent | ❌ No async artifact review |\n| **Plan/Fast modes** | Deliberate planning vs direct execution | ❌ Single execution mode |\n| **Knowledge Items** | Persistent patterns across conversations | ❌ No cross-session learning |\n| **Knowledge management** | Agent saves useful snippets/patterns | ❌ No knowledge base |\n\n### Why This Gap Exists\n\n1. **Architecture**: Entire is git-native (hooks-based), Antigravity is IDE-native with embedded agent brain\n2. **No Antigravity hooks**: Unlike Claude Code (`session-start`, `stop`, etc.), Antigravity has no lifecycle hooks documented\n3. **Different paradigm**: Antigravity is \"agent-first\" where surfaces are embedded in the agent; Entire is \"git-first\" where agent sessions are captured\n\n### Opportunity: How Entire Could Fill This Gap\n\n**Possible integrations:**\n\n1. **Antigravity Agent → Entire checkpoints**: Capture Antigravity sessions in git\n2. **Entire as Antigravity's memory**: Use checkpoints as knowledge base for Antigravity agents\n3. **Cross-agent workflow**: Antigravity for execution, Entire for audit trail/rewind\n4. **Artifact → checkpoint bridge**: Map Antigravity artifacts to checkpoint metadata\n\n**Challenges:**\n- Antigravity has no documented hooks system like Claude Code\n- It's primarily IDE-based, not CLI-based\n- No open plugin/extension API visible yet\n\n### What Would Need to Be Built\n\n```\nAntigravity → Checkpoint Bridge\n├── Antigravity API/plugin discovery\n├── Hook system for Antigravity lifecycle\n├── Artifact → checkpoint mapping\n├── Knowledge base integration\n└── Multi-agent orchestration UI\n```\n\nWould you like me to explore implementing Antigravity support or dig deeper into the technical feasibility?",
